{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_title", "source_sha256": "e8c46f1b0752a2de43e7761edbe948e5b55d5dc32e45030279fa708b699d0efe", "ja": "本当のアイドル", "zh": "真正的偶像", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_synopsis", "source_sha256": "49aa5cc87993fabbfd931f872424348440a43ca966436c59aa2b9ddc9b4e27d6", "ja": "センター公演を控えて、奈緒、百合子と共に\nレッスンに取り組む杏奈。先輩の春香達のよ\nうな公演ができるか不安だったものの、亜美\nと真美の言葉を参考に、観客と一緒に自分も\n楽しむアイドルらしいライブを成功させる。", "zh": "Center公演近在眼前，杏奈开始和奈绪、百合\n子一起练习。尽管她心里很担心，不知是否能\n完成像春香前辈她们那样的公演，但在受到亚\n美和真美启发之后，杏奈成功打造出很有偶像\n风范的演唱会，让自己跟观众都十分尽兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4d8abfadba1f548a62706b1f2302547446bb54fa68fcf673570c24531906b606", "ja": "（次の公演のセンターは、杏奈に決まった。\n少し不安だと言っていたけど、様子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（下次公演的Center，决定由杏奈来担任。\n她曾说过有点不安，不知道现在状况如何？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "d3d6e8899689b6d6196aa2214374b3b73f5c0b927e049df70170033073f292ec", "ja": "はぁ～、今日もいい汗かいたわ。\n杏奈、百合子、レッスンお疲れ～！", "zh": "呼～今天也流了好多汗啊。\n杏奈、百合子，练习辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "f9e3b4614b438d94fae6b743fa191d7822d63e60efb352f0aef653bda9ffead0", "ja": "はい、お疲れさまです！　杏奈ちゃん、すごかったね！\nさっきのダンス、完璧だったよ！", "zh": "是，大家辛苦了！小杏，你好厉害！\n刚刚的舞跳得很完美耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "2934e7e5d348af1d541d99f1b2f48ad5ee075c1d2eb2a4fc314ef727e4d0fdd7", "ja": "ホンマやで。レッスンとかライブん時の杏奈は、\nめっちゃハイテンションで、いつも別人に見えるわ。", "zh": "就是说呀。杏奈在练习跟开演唱会的时候都超级嗨的，\n简直像是换了一个人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "5672db2f874073958fcff5088649cd0ece846ad98ed5559c9e8548ffc4fd02dd", "ja": "わかりますっ！　キラキラしてて……\nザ・アイドルって感じですよね！", "zh": "我可以理解！整个人变得很耀眼……\n给人一种「正统派偶像」的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e71e2193b330f2e38e629d7b733cbb12a78672857ac3be5f5f5a98646063dd68", "ja": "（レッスンの時の杏奈は、そんなに調子がよかった\nのか。俺の心配は余計だったかな……？）", "zh": "（杏奈练习时状态那么好吗？\n或许是我白担心了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "61e720e43b0dd0bfa90fbb9b234a6760af3bf7da36e9b9c2b80a3894b26c63ac", "ja": "……でも………………ううん、なんでもない。\n………………。", "zh": "……可是………………没事，当杏奈没说。\n………………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1008_p", "source_sha256": "aa75cab118eb2db33385e689a46367b3c3141507115fcfc8fe854e7827346bc3", "ja": "（調子がよかったにしては、様子が変だな……）", "zh": "（如果她状态很好，这样的反应不太正常……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_1009", "source_sha256": "8206aa242a1ce95352b204e4effc351c88d6ace42ca2699712fc94a3257f70be", "ja": "大丈夫か？", "zh": "还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0b52621556d7b6102738f37ca4e1e7f922ea648feaad509eb13cd7fd4e873040", "ja": "どうした、杏奈。大丈夫か？", "zh": "怎么了，杏奈？你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2001_024ann", "source_sha256": "d3a1ba6cb6b29a741093a1a9bf7c085681a35a1a818984554bca578309e2fd0e", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2002_p", "source_sha256": "7c0fad69213d3f62b99c5243ba0b663d7db3231ac699e752ec161f9f9084fb7d", "ja": "今、何か言いたいことがあるみたいだったけど、\n遠慮なく言っていいんだぞ？", "zh": "你刚刚好像有什么话想说，\n不用客气，尽管说出来没关系喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2003_024ann", "source_sha256": "1614e9f0021a2d0eea402310b525542dad5b9826daf925a6710930eb8c48f829", "ja": "…………ん。……じゃあ…………。", "zh": "…………嗯……那…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2004_024ann", "source_sha256": "17c531efe2626b93f3bd91ebe3d798755da8a3605f5e018e865cad676972e449", "ja": "…………あの、ね……、杏奈、練習は……\nうまくできたけど……本番は……心配…………。", "zh": "…………那个……杏奈练习……虽然很顺利……\n但还是会担心……正式表演出错…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2005_024ann", "source_sha256": "8bfb80f312ee17dc66a76c33162accf43bb4f2c40ae16f410b14d61dcc28a1a1", "ja": "……杏奈、劇場に来て……、春香さんや千早さん達を\n見て…………本当のアイドルだって思った……。", "zh": "……杏奈来剧场……看了春香和千早她们的表演…………\n觉得她们不愧是真正的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2006_024ann", "source_sha256": "5d04b1708953811ae996f302c7e9563a607ceaa1752ae255798d51deb7cc46e6", "ja": "……本物って、すごい……よね。杏奈が思ってた\nのより…………ずっと……すごかった…………。", "zh": "……真正的偶像……好厉害喔。\n比杏奈想像中……还要……更让人惊艳…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2007_037nao", "source_sha256": "b46355e5903b382fb41e0a87310ad6e6ddb6ab4bedde01379c0ee00bdb98adf4", "ja": "んー、せやなあ。\n今の私らよりは、だいぶ光ってるなあ……。", "zh": "嗯～是没错啦。\n确实是比现在的我们还要耀眼得多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2008_024ann", "source_sha256": "e4a475d90c83645b79cfbaaa07a0dddb21f5c4e4ee084f9071ef45b8fb2f0784", "ja": "春香さん達も……立つことがあるステージ……だよ。\nきっと……今の杏奈じゃ……、足りない…………。", "zh": "那是春香她们……曾经站上过的舞台……喔。\n现在的杏奈……一定……还不够好…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2009_026yur", "source_sha256": "71f8e1a968d3c3aee552d5e055eaa4d4192f65d69fbd20b503fee72b83d9943e", "ja": "それって……すごい！　杏奈ちゃんもすごいよ！\n今よりもっと上を目指すってことだよね！？", "zh": "这个想法……好棒！小杏也很厉害耶！\n你想表现得比现在更好，对不对！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2010_026yur", "source_sha256": "6f336368e73465d6b7722b1506c1abf69a8d97702a7e9e8cf35fa5aa54809c02", "ja": "私も見習わなきゃ……一緒に頑張ろう、杏奈ちゃん！\n私にできることなら、なんでもするから！", "zh": "我也得向你学习……我们一起加油吧，小杏！\n如果有我做得到的事情，我都会帮忙的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2011_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b178c9f3202ec43fb0f532ca32fb62fea989e8c6497960acbef2d6104a84fcf", "ja": "うんうん、これでも私ら、一応センター経験者\nやからな！　杏奈のためなら、力になるで～！", "zh": "嗯嗯，再怎么说，我们也算是当过Center呀！\n只要是为了杏奈，我们一定会帮忙啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2012_024ann", "source_sha256": "20669b50d918ff1d983caf7682df558ce2c0c89aa899671745cdae5bfd19d8f7", "ja": "百合子さん……奈緒さん……。\n…………ありがと。", "zh": "百合子……奈绪……\n…………谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2013_026yur", "source_sha256": "4ce5bc67f114b8b805dda48840878643267fe6e709cc3d7e4c61fe2d6de9cff5", "ja": "でも、何から始めたらいいのかな？　レッスンは、\nもうしてるし……{$P$}さーん！！", "zh": "那要从哪里开始着手呢？我们也有在练习了……\n{$P$}先生──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2014_p", "source_sha256": "0ae740829cff8e1670d98568e15be90f584440968dc6b8b8822edb781435c1dc", "ja": "うん、みんなの意気込みはわかった！　でも、\n何をすべきかは考えてみるから、少し時間を……。", "zh": "嗯，我感受到大家的决心了！\n不过我要思考一下该怎么做，给我一点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2015_011ami", "source_sha256": "545012098de5dc63d544dea091737b4a616ee2dd175c394b2c2a2df99035c237", "ja": "話はすべて、ぬすみぎきさせていただいたー！", "zh": "一切原委，我们都已经偷听得一清二楚──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2016_p", "source_sha256": "f90cff82b158b85570d885df2adb1ba3f8f8010ae012b70f873740792f366b05", "ja": "（この声は……）", "zh": "（这声音是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2017_012mam", "source_sha256": "827ae757116d3f72ab25626dacb6a16203dc3fab0624f927cad96ab11c92cd3f", "ja": "正義のアイドル魔法使い仮面、亜美と真美、参上っ！\n……もっちー、本物のアイドルになりたいのかね？", "zh": "正义的偶像魔法使假面，亚美和真美登场！\n……望望，你想要成为真正的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2018_024ann", "source_sha256": "6008c4a236846e57a879e49ac4ac8be556fca3d00f579b252e2c4431004f4fd3", "ja": "……え……あ……。う、うん…………。", "zh": "……咦……啊……嗯、嗯…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2019_011ami", "source_sha256": "8d28c357706c798d328625ec58c480a6e46433d602f7b35268dc2dd4d66f3ed0", "ja": "その願い、この、愛の美少女アイドル戦隊、\n亜美と真美が、かなえてしんぜようー！！", "zh": "你的愿望，就由爱的美少女偶像战队，\n亚美和真美来帮你实现吧──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2020_p", "source_sha256": "e18c04e8c7e942bb72d61b26d781f616655acc8be941bdd9f21631c686ec5d3b", "ja": "名前が変わってるじゃないか！　亜美も真美も、\n遊ぶなら、向こうで遊びなさい。杏奈は忙しいから。", "zh": "名字怎么跟刚才不一样！亚美、真美，\n要玩就去其他地方玩。杏奈现在很忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2021_012mam", "source_sha256": "52e7a656b01f9f4c229d252ee9b35689666353ed0e4e35c0a2b15097d7766363", "ja": "えー！　せっかく、真美たちがお手本になって、\n悩めるもっちーに色々教えてあげよーと思ったのにー。", "zh": "咦──！难得真美我们想做个示范，\n好好指导一下正在烦恼的望望耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2022_011ami", "source_sha256": "09cc0f0a3548a35f7aaffe32170ad9d4fbfaa4c7bdbd35d781ec7289cbeab659", "ja": "そーだよ、兄ちゃん！　亜美たちがもっちーに、\n『真・アイドル奥義』を授けようと思ってたんだよー。", "zh": "就是说啊，大哥哥！\n亚美我们正打算把『真‧偶像奥义』传授给望望的说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2023_p", "source_sha256": "1ac3a791ecf5efcfff1464541bb96169b173a224c95193a25cec661a85ca4632", "ja": "亜美と真美がお手本に……？　まあ、二人も杏奈の言う\n『本物のアイドル』ではあると思うが……。", "zh": "亚美和真美要示范……？\n这个，杏奈口中的『真正的偶像』的确包含你们在内……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2024_p", "source_sha256": "8b88643133526be902eef151d0199ea1feb386fafcf0da995eea9407a3280300", "ja": "手本としては、高度すぎるというか。", "zh": "但以参考范本来说，难度好像有点太高了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2025_024ann", "source_sha256": "0cf311da7a682ceea09125457761b59d4e09ecb8c9f5db6c12540df92ff18086", "ja": "……でも、杏奈…………、\n二人の話……きいてみたい…………な。", "zh": "……可是，杏奈…………\n想听听……她们的话…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2026_p", "source_sha256": "20cf84f3cb3fd0c673abff9038a52f79076715921acf1b77030ee337822785b4", "ja": "うーん、杏奈がそう言うなら……。\nじゃあ、亜美、真美、頼むよ。", "zh": "嗯～既然杏奈这么说……\n亚美、真美，就麻烦你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2027_011ami", "source_sha256": "6d8bd6d16249d3fffdc847b689c4530d4ce39550fda68249037786a058d7036c", "ja": "んっふっふ～、そうこなくっちゃだよ～。\nんじゃ、さっそく修行始めるよ、もっちー？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～这样才对嘛～\n好啦，那就赶快开始修行吧，望望～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2028_024ann", "source_sha256": "4a2f3f6981ebed0a6efc4db7531b2d4334d859a8f87b63e29b8d59a7d0fb7dcc", "ja": "…………修行？", "zh": "…………修行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2029_012mam", "source_sha256": "d5dc96f67834d19b3608086ee827dc238dcd58cd60a200a86fd609cd65610403", "ja": "さあ、もっちー、これはお仕事だって思って、\n本気で真美たちのマネをしてみてねー！", "zh": "来，望望，你把这件事想像成工作，\n认真模仿真美我们喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2030_012mam", "source_sha256": "b77f8796210c5a8ea43a2fda6b21aea432a0a49ee4e011fc3941c22762eb5936", "ja": "まずは、これだっ！\n『うっうー！　ハイ、ターッチ！　いぇい！』", "zh": "首先是这个！\n『呜呜──！好，击──掌！！耶！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2031_024ann", "source_sha256": "1589597e820c3c7708514b40411b7c8f7b7f245409d8b6266cf5e424d655b69d", "ja": "うっうー！　ビビッとハイ、ターッチ！　イエイ！", "zh": "呜呜──！充满活力地击──掌！耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2032_011ami", "source_sha256": "7fb32e035d9b501ede8bf8d641e416f046e1c4aad34b1b148dba719f4038ad3b", "ja": "いいよ、いいよー！\n『キリキリ働きなさーいっ！　にひひっ♪』はいっ！", "zh": "很好很好～！\n『给我认真工作喔～！咿嘻嘻♪』，换你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2033_024ann", "source_sha256": "3ea6a6757e889cdff3081195341f808f9738fb6d18bde2fa26c7f7ebbf382394", "ja": "GOGO～！　キリキリ働きなさーい！\nに、にひひっ♪", "zh": "GOGO～！给我认真工作喔～！\n咿、咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2034_012mam", "source_sha256": "b9ddbe9cf9d912e18a36b512025231affee2f4e8613f4b9912556ce3905a9d40", "ja": "んじゃ次は、『穴掘って\n埋まっておきますぅ……ぐすっ……』はいっ！", "zh": "接着是，\n『我要先挖洞把自己埋起来……呜……』，换你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2035_024ann", "source_sha256": "a47db15db13f06f9374c71cb8c379cbaac590fc4691dce69a1ba829a4fe4a36d", "ja": "あ、穴掘って、イエイ！\n埋まって……おき、おきますぅ……！", "zh": "我、我要先挖洞，耶！\n把自己……埋、埋起来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2036_011ami", "source_sha256": "622751dddaac17f8815e80aff2156ff6208e309cd1ae8c1e8e877d8926d3190e", "ja": "OK、次！　『んっふっふ～！　亜美のナイスバディ\n光線で兄ちゃんはメロメロ～ン！』はいっ！", "zh": "OK，下一个！『嗯哼哼～亚美的魔鬼身材光线\n把大哥哥迷得团团转～！』，换你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2037_024ann", "source_sha256": "f6d27cc17ffdff5c6d88bf788977e1ac4e6a1b8a7ef513c6cc9f61807328b655", "ja": "……ん、んっふっふ～！　杏奈のナイスバディ光線、\nで……兄ちゃんは…………はうう！！", "zh": "……嗯、嗯哼哼～杏奈的魔鬼身材光线……\n把大哥哥…………啊呜！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_2038", "source_sha256": "3947f85de9fe43191269923de37294fd5917da7197c8d25c1eebf73254544b9f", "ja": "ストップ！", "zh": "暂停！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3000_p", "source_sha256": "1af758f9a274f5cba540d6194755af66b4728489eedd7bece45672cbcda6c299", "ja": "こらこら、ストップ！　そこまでだー！！", "zh": "喂喂喂，给我暂停！到此为止──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3002_p", "source_sha256": "a02a785f41ec32e135912ab01ec9943eafdb95b2bdbf8556571d8b92a0fc9d67", "ja": "あ、杏奈、しっかりしろ！　ちょっと休んで、\n気持ちを落ち着けるんだぞ？　それにしても……！！", "zh": "杏、杏奈，振作一点！你稍作休息，\n平复一下心情。话说回来……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3003_p", "source_sha256": "6459faeceef1c420c878a7566278d84427176a640172f1004521ed42b267bad1", "ja": "こらっ、亜美、真美！　何が『真・アイドル奥義』だ！\n二人が杏奈で遊んでるだけじゃないか！！", "zh": "真是的，亚美、真美！什么『真‧偶像奥义』啊！\n你们只是在把杏奈耍着玩吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3004_012mam", "source_sha256": "43a66712207219c3e7bb105cf6b689a906ccd70e4467f78ba708faa286eed556", "ja": "わー、兄ちゃんが怒ったー！\nでもでも、面白かったっしょ！？", "zh": "哇～大哥哥生气了～！\n可是可是，很有趣吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3005_011ami", "source_sha256": "0ca5569b784762e26002b854753f8309c560ef80e58e78cb5ed9107dc5c1bf3b", "ja": "ライブも面白いよー！　みんなと一緒に歌うのって\nサイコーっしょ！　では、さらばじゃー！", "zh": "演唱会也很有趣喔～！\n和大家一起唱歌最棒了！那就后会有期啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3006_p", "source_sha256": "8deea80a307f70b988ecfeaa0a5ba63104ba55d07638c1eeeadcdbc4daa44384", "ja": "やれやれ……。ごめんな、杏奈。", "zh": "真伤脑筋……抱歉，杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3007_024ann", "source_sha256": "0eac4fd07709a1c6db8c4a42da9d076fc6e6d5f9c9b5c7ded52b0da240e606d8", "ja": "……大丈夫。でも…………杏奈、本当のアイドルが\n…………少しわからなくなった…………かも。", "zh": "……没关系。不过…………杏奈好像变得不太了解\n…………什么是真正的…………偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3008_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b51d341f4627ab3c8cabe1ea452d1fc9311a99c1e87f586680566b92680f0de", "ja": "あかんやん！　も～、あの二人はー！\n杏奈を余計に不安にさせて、どないするんや～！", "zh": "根本没用嘛！吼～那两个人真是的～！\n怎么反而让杏奈更不安了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3009_026yur", "source_sha256": "8d5c080ef75ff00d4c4690f9bc9c8536075dcd3df6a4986f75038b6c041133d1", "ja": "でも、ちょっと見応えありましたけどね、\n『真・アイドル奥義』発動中の杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "不过，还满有看头的呢，\n发动『真‧偶像奥义』时的小杏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3010_026yur", "source_sha256": "957b145d40f0eff1dcf1f487630061d9e76cdae385805b134c147be439be55a9", "ja": "あっ、ごめんね、杏奈ちゃんは大変だったよね。", "zh": "啊，对不起。小杏你应该累坏了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3011_024ann", "source_sha256": "84344fdef5f0692f421b35bfdcc833a200ad5abad3cdcb6850fa917415b553f0", "ja": "……ん、もう平気。\n…………ちょっと疲れた……けど。", "zh": "……嗯，杏奈没事。\n…………只是有点……累了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3012_p", "source_sha256": "bef34157773a8476235ec3ae5abd14686ea3461a04c9e624c3c2d3fb8b37fecf", "ja": "あの二人の言うことを全部聞いていたら、\nそうなるんだよな……。", "zh": "如果完全照着她们说的话做，\n当然会这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3013_p", "source_sha256": "7d2daaf67bbad87b14c8faf6537d13929f4ae63bf160b4243de9862be87e6fca", "ja": "だから、半分くらいでちょうどいいんだ。\nあれでもたまには、いいことも言ってくれるんだぞ？", "zh": "所以，她们的话你只要听一半就好了。\n虽然她们老是那样，但偶尔也会说出有帮助的话喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3014_037nao", "source_sha256": "c4ec4f627d678a9074b67c93d618e8ea70a326e43c641dcab5bcb1dc2a4e080a", "ja": "ええこと……。\nはっ、亜美のバディに兄ちゃんがメロメロ～ン？", "zh": "有帮助的话……\n啊，亚美的魔鬼身材把大哥哥迷得团团转？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3015_p", "source_sha256": "c06fddafff49a8af1d3e4d99b054f81f4c32bf5fb16acef20076c4c6b6b3390d", "ja": "そこじゃない。\nというかメロメロンでもないからな？", "zh": "不是那一句。\n而且我也没有被迷得团团转好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3016_026yur", "source_sha256": "1f0521b87600c07530c82889183125e135e4e72278b3130ab43b8c650239f28b", "ja": "あっ！　最後に『ライブも面白い』って……。\n亜美ちゃん、そう言ってたよね？", "zh": "啊！『演唱会也很有趣』……\n亚美最后有这么说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3017_024ann", "source_sha256": "706fc93763feecd2cbc0713af44bd0fd4d8fe4a936f5d9fde15b3cc294d7668e", "ja": "…………うん。杏奈はライブ……緊張する、けど、\n亜美ちゃんは……面白い、サイコー…………って……。", "zh": "…………嗯。杏奈在演唱会上……会很紧张，\n可是亚美……却说演唱会很有趣、最棒了…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3018_026yur", "source_sha256": "430c944cb810680c9ca65dffa464c24703c9c6fc69d40635a79bad71d2f9db5f", "ja": "でも、亜美ちゃんたちは全然緊張しないんでしょうか？\nやっぱり、ライブに慣れてるから？", "zh": "不过，亚美她们真的完全不会紧张吗？\n果然是因为她们很习惯演唱会了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3019_037nao", "source_sha256": "06838c59decc83a20608d1b651f2389b97330d1f54764f73d33710b067b535ab", "ja": "そんなことないんちゃう？　私は何回ライブ出ても、\n最初の時と同じように緊張しまくるし……。", "zh": "应该不是吧？我不管出场几次，\n都和第一次开演唱会的时候一样紧张得要命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3020_037nao", "source_sha256": "36cf958fdc44cc2b36649a57d0db9c8f9db2260e3789db1a67b3b259f59c4217", "ja": "それはずっと変わらへんのちゃうかな～。\n亜美と真美も、きっとそうやと思うけど。", "zh": "这种事应该不会变吧～\n亚美和真美肯定也是啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3021_026yur", "source_sha256": "f44669ba6c19280013f7da1f4baf79705fd4e4b0933cda568cc41f93beb44f8c", "ja": "じゃあ、真美ちゃんたちも緊張はしているけど、\n面白がろうと頑張ってる、ってことですか？", "zh": "所以真美她们其实也会紧张，\n只是她们也会努力让演唱会变得有趣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3022_p", "source_sha256": "a2a0b87e956e43b4b82ecd85d3025ba7833959642fe8986995c8ff2e629db394", "ja": "はは、そこまで真面目に考えてないと思うけど。\nただ、あの二人はよく知ってるんだろう。", "zh": "哈哈，她们应该没那想那么多。\n不过她们很清楚一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3023_p", "source_sha256": "99473bced0dba5ded8bf87422e65e55353823e5ddf35222443557848aebed179", "ja": "ライブは、ものすごく『楽しめる』ものだって。", "zh": "那就是，演唱会是很值得「享受」的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3024_026yur", "source_sha256": "69ede414f855540f70a554da8fdd70c9c24b6b82b2ad9b3fce52cb35bfb3a070", "ja": "楽しめる……。", "zh": "享受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3025_037nao", "source_sha256": "7fc2b2dd2a87cfe740f3487527c46a3ffbef154c79b6506e9336b6e32040e03a", "ja": "楽しいものやなくて、楽しめるもの、かぁ……。\nあははっ、なんや、わかるようでわからんなあ！", "zh": "不是很开心，而是很享受吗……？\n啊哈哈！什么呀，好像听懂了又好像没懂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3026_024ann", "source_sha256": "9bc607c5734212cef1632005e03e9effbfd24fbaada787aead176c1d750a0a6f", "ja": "…………そっか……。やっぱり、すごい……んだね。\n……本物の……アイドルって………………。", "zh": "…………这样啊……果然……很厉害呢。\n……真正的……偶像………………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3027_p", "source_sha256": "f0a26a670af1087f0b3029f8113ca52ad4f3aca3d50c29f91286577c8eec2a03", "ja": "『本物』って言うけど、杏奈たちだって、\nもう本物のアイドルだぞ。", "zh": "虽然杏奈一直说她们是『真正的』，\n但杏奈你们也已经是真正的偶像了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3028_024ann", "source_sha256": "711a8123048813869fccf8c8e8f509ae475866f2f1cf981dcbeb37634f2a8f38", "ja": "……杏奈たち…………も？", "zh": "……杏奈我们…………也是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3029_p", "source_sha256": "63b0ca20766fbeb5634f1ecc25eeb77dad881a93581a8698e1b33adc7b3d60b5", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。ファンにとってはね。", "zh": "嗯，没错，粉丝们是这么认为的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3030_p", "source_sha256": "80c5976adf343c67fe15eb1b390afd4bd99421533cf3d7165a18ec31d5de0ad4", "ja": "もちろん、先輩たちに恥ずかしくないステージに\nしようって杏奈たちの向上心は、大事なものだ。", "zh": "当然，杏奈你们肯去努力呈现不输给前辈们的表演，\n这份上进心是很重要没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3031_p", "source_sha256": "b52cfb48936595827eb058be65be827e5b8c4523c8d37e8527993142205b479f", "ja": "けど、亜美たちみたいに気楽に、楽しもう！\n……って気持ちも、忘れないでいてくれ。", "zh": "不过，也别忘记了……\n像亚美她们那样，随心所欲享受舞台的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3032_024ann", "source_sha256": "937c7094b3ace973e2004fd48b0fa8bb18e6d45682a415cabcac7c12992d3575", "ja": "……そだね。杏奈……いっぱい、楽しむ……。\n……みんなと、一緒に。", "zh": "……说得也是。杏奈……会和大家一起……\n好好享受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3033_024ann", "source_sha256": "e030b66567f7aba4e9795cda2ded380c8b0504678b8ff1ea0170be7ebef06cfc", "ja": "百合子さん……奈緒さん……。", "zh": "百合子……奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3034_026yur", "source_sha256": "0af591bc146d8b5f8b141f40c2049cb2fa7c09d4932532c38c30f398e9d12dd1", "ja": "どうしたの、杏奈ちゃん？", "zh": "怎么了，小杏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3035_024ann", "source_sha256": "3a40efee323920e475a4bbe6203bed7691a216234f67658684b26ab9fb696801", "ja": "……杏奈……一人で考えると…………時々\n考えすぎちゃう……こともある……から…………。", "zh": "……杏奈……自己在想事情的时候…………\n有时也会……想得太多…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3036_024ann", "source_sha256": "215367b5bdc2d5a647b566a5311a98e3afd673dc240a80daece206da3ae56707", "ja": "その時は……今日みたい、に……\nお話……聞いて……もらえません……か？", "zh": "所以到时……你们愿意……\n像今天一样……听杏奈说……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3037_037nao", "source_sha256": "78f79e42ff5cd8b380db02ae5c5d76c2dadd1df6847aa9968a252163978228c7", "ja": "そんなん当たり前やん！　任せといて！", "zh": "那是当然的呀！交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3038_026yur", "source_sha256": "2a994cd2e6a8591839aa64e19cd9587f690193105f6ab2514de7e8f7524614e5", "ja": "なんでも話して、杏奈ちゃん。そして、\n一緒に公演楽しもうね！　頑張ろう！", "zh": "什么事都可以跟我说喔，小杏。\n然后，我们一起享受公演吧！加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3039_024ann", "source_sha256": "b06bc29a6e7dded58f6c0d106f00c9008bad19a87700aaddc23cb493ee1f6cea", "ja": "えへへ……ありがと…………♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你们…………♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_013_3040_024ann", "source_sha256": "5aed81cbc5bc3667304246aed4ea472922259c173d2329ba8e511f1899cf1473", "ja": "杏奈……なんだか……ワクワク、して……きたよ、\n……{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "杏奈……总觉得……期待……起来了。\n……{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
